note mix.om: refused by omc with error 12
fn mix a ulong b ulong c ulong d ulong e ulong f ulong to ulong
p = mul a d
q = mul b e
r = mul c f
s = add a b
t = add c d
u = add e f
v = xor p q
w = xor q r
x = add s t
y = add u v
z = add w x
ret add add add p q add r y add add z s add t u
end
fn main to int
k = mix 3 5 7 11 13 17
ret int rem k 251
end
